{"id":"steam-993280","steam":993280,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Gourmet Food Wizard","summary":"This is a real time card combat game with magic and gourmet food!Players [B] capture magic objects, make food, use a super variety of magic [/ B], set foot on the adventure!The game level is randomly generated, the enemy is a new concept of no health, please enjoy the battle of releasing magic!","about":"It's a world of magic and gourmet food!Players play as the Mester,  capture magic objects, make food, use a super variety of magic , embark on an adventure to find the Spar of All Magic!\r\n \nReal-time combat + card mechanics!\n : Unlike ordinary turn-based card printing games, A Bite of Morserker combines the real-time combat system with the game mechanics of card strategy, giving players a brand new combat experience!\r\n \nMonsters without health design\n  no longer need to tedious calculation of enemy health!The traditional enemy health design has been abolished!Brainless use the corresponding magic element to defeat the enemy just!\r\n \ncapture of magic objects\n  : the main character needs to capture magic objects as food, to make a variety of food, so that they have enough physical strength to fight against magic objects on the road of magic adventure!\r\n \nRandom Generated Levels\n  : From Endless Desert, Deep Cave, Dragon's Roar Dungeon to Endless Desert, Death Lava Island, etc., the internal roads, enemies and organs, NPCs and trigger events are all randomly generated, and each adventure will be a different experience!\r\nThe game is now in the early experience stage, we have many ideas, need more time to improve the game slowly!Hope everyone can put forward a lot of valuable opinions, we together to complete this lovely magic food world!\r\nIf the game is popular, we will add multiplayer mode in the future, and the interaction between players will be more important!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/993280/li